  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Border Management and Border Security in Rwanda through the Implementation of Advanced Passenger Information (API)/Passenger Name Record (PNR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to contribute to the Government of Rwanda (GOR)&apos;s endeavour to provide safe migration routes for Rwanda nationals, migrants and transiting passengers and complement the government&apos;s efforts to establish its Advanced Passenger Information/Passenger Name Record (API/PNR) system. In order to do so, this project will support the development of legal and technical frameworks and the institutional capacities of the government for the smooth implementation of the API/PNR system in Rwanda.</narrative>
  </description>
